              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Sarah Jo"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is really good. I use my own taco seasoning in this recipe and I also stir in a 4 ounce can of diced mild green chilies. When I make this, it disappears very quickly. If you can make this sooner rather than later, you'll be glad you did. The longer it sits, the better it gets."
