            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "kpoole060270"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I had to be on the road in about 20 minutes for a party. I planned to grab an appetizer at the store. I did a quick check through allrecipes ingredient search and I found this recipe. Easy (5 minutes) and faster than running to the store (plus still enough time to write this review). It tastes yummy and (don't tell anyone) but I did not have green chilies so I just added about 8 packets of leftover Taco Bell sauce! lol",
