            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "superbuuck"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Very easy to make! I whipped it up in 5 minutes. I didn't have a can of green chilis so I used a can of ROTEL tomatoes and chili's and it was great. Seems very similar to other reviews that said to add some tomatoes. It was gone in 30 minutes - no time to meld flavors. IT WAS GONE! Sprinkle some powdered cayenne pepper on top to kick it up a notch!",
