              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Pizza_Momma"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was a hit with my friends. I omitted the black olives and green chilies and added chopped jalapenos and finely diced red pepper and used half of the amount of reduced salt Taco seasoning mix. It was fast and easy and I served it with vegetable crudites :)",
